<title>USA: SouthFirst sees acquisitions accretive.</title>
<headline>SouthFirst sees acquisitions accretive.</headline>
<dateline>SYLACAUGA, Ala 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>SouthFirst Bancshares Inc said Friday that it expects its recent acquisitions to be immediately accretive.</p>
<p>The company has acquired Pension &amp; Benefit Financial Services Inc, an employee benefit consulting firm in Montgomery, Alabama, and in April it said its subsidiary had definitively agreed to merge with First Federal Savings and Loan Association of Chilton County, headquartered in Clanton, Alabama.</p>
<p>&quot;Management believes that both acquisitions will be immediately accretive to earnings per share,&quot; SouthFirst said Friday.</p>
</text>
